End's Delight for Horizon 26.3 (version 2.5-horizon.4)

A port of End's Delight refabricated-1.20.1-2.5 by FoggyHillside.
Original source: https://github.com/FoggyHillside/End-s-Delight (branch 1.20.1-Refabricated)
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: a content package (no code). The items, blocks, textures, models and data
are carried over from the original jar and converted to Horizon's content format. Its End Stove,
feasts, dragon leg, chorus succulent, sneak-teleporting foods and loot run on the farmersdelight
package (Farmer's Delight for Horizon) 0.5 or later, which it needs. This port is distributed under
the same licence as the original (MIT); the jar has no licence file, so LICENSE is the original
repository's (branch 1.20.1-Refabricated).
